    "description": "Everything in VIP, with faster crafting and the best kit on the server.\nPerks:\n- [ELITE] tag in chat\n- /kit elite once per wipe\n- 3x gather rate and 50% faster crafting\n- Top of the queue\n- 6 home teleports and /remove\n- All VIP perks",
    "prices": [
     {
      "currency": "${currency}",
      "cycle": "monthly",
      "amount": "9.99"
