      "type": "text",
      "props": {
       "title": "Server rules",
       "body": "1. No cheating, scripting, macros or exploiting bugs.\n2. Group limit: 4 players. No alliances above the limit.\n3. No racism, hate speech or harassment in chat or voice.\n4. No advertising other servers.\n5. Do not impersonate staff.\n6. Staff decisions are final. Appeals go through a ticket.\n\nBreaking the rules can lead to a ban without a refund of purchased perks."
      }
